A complete practical and academic programme (@em-programme: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electromagnetism, #source "../sources/Electromagnetism-II-MIT-8-07.lingua#r_55A4EMWVVACC6KS4Z03ZA91F7G", #source "../sources/Electromagnetic-Theory-MIT-8-311.lingua#r_76PF2M392RCSAEEF88YX03ZEBH", #source "../sources/Electromagnetics-and-Applications-Staelin.lingua#r_45QC1TW6RXJBJE8Q5H98DZT5AC", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-boundary-Green-function-and-multipole-study.lingua#r_7K6DMSWN5GFG0AH1HFEQFYJ6HR", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-dielectric-response-and-material-measurement-study.lingua#r_44CZN17YHR59MS1T36SKB30FQB", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-magnetic-circuits-materials-and-coupling-study.lingua#r_3YQ7495PSE5THZV9FVQ9FR18F6", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-circuit-to-field-and-probe-study.lingua#r_3NMAAA6ARRKBX261QBQV9M3N43", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-electromechanical-energy-and-stress-study.lingua#r_3J775PFRNMS0G28Q2B6CXSHJME", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-relativistic-field-and-action-study.lingua#r_1PN7ASKXD515XZCY9T1FDPJCP5", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-causal-dispersive-pulse-study.lingua#r_2JT83809PYYT57JSB8JGW8QPBK", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-lines-guides-resonance-and-mode-study.lingua#r_5BWBKTPS1G0F85NTJ0NSS5KYBT", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-retarded-fields-radiation-and-antenna-study.lingua#r_0AYMD9A6TZ9TFTAD9YFZZRP45E", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-scattering-extinction-and-material-response-study.lingua#r_6VQB1CK8FSP8M7MCCWHH8Y6NSR", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-static-numerical-field-verification-study.lingua#r_0HV1EN0TSCEJ133D4S253Z0PXD", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-time-domain-dispersion-PML-and-validation-study.lingua#r_3DN369CNVW889T4MG6CAAXJGCV", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-electromagnetic-inverse-problem-study.lingua#r_4AAZ68A806WG3FF0AE5YMMN3F6", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-electromagnetic-experimental-methods-study.lingua#r_6V7JSTPNM2G9CRC96YV3T2BMHD", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-microscopic-and-macroscopic-matter-comparison.lingua#r_5HN81SGXA3VBCNETQYY3X7EHJ9", #electromagnetism "../research/Advanced-electromagnetic-infrastructure-interface-study.lingua#r_44M1PWKW6K4PPNWW9PYTZVQFTD") { r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX
**Read:** [Electromagnetism II — MIT 8.07, Fall 2012](../sources/Electromagnetism-II-MIT-8-07.lingua#r_55A4EMWVVACC6KS4Z03ZA91F7G), the complete public course; [Electromagnetic Theory — MIT 8.311, Spring 2004](../sources/Electromagnetic-Theory-MIT-8-311.lingua#r_76PF2M392RCSAEEF88YX03ZEBH), the complete available graduate programme; [Electromagnetics and Applications — David H. Staelin](../sources/Electromagnetics-and-Applications-Staelin.lingua#r_45QC1TW6RXJBJE8Q5H98DZT5AC), the entire text, or the entire Haus–Melcher alternative.

The broad reading is the complete electricity/magnetism portion of [University Physics Volume 2 — OpenStax](../sources/University-Physics-Volume-2.lingua#r_5JQ0CPQ0RNJNVH175Y9V305J5Q); both complete [Electromagnetics Volume 1 — Steven W. Ellingson](../sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-1-Ellingson.lingua#r_30KS80JAJY91W0FGZMASQW9DJA) and [Electromagnetics Volume 2 — Steven W. Ellingson](../sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-2-Ellingson.lingua#r_5P52CZD00XV6MMPFY9RHADT5KJ) volumes; all of the current [Electromagnetism — David Tong](../sources/Electromagnetism-Tong.lingua#r_278NEA0Z85RJZSPXQ8G55E3SR1) and [Classical Electromagnetism — Richard Fitzpatrick](../sources/Classical-Electromagnetism-Fitzpatrick.lingua#r_7NH7AZZH3NZ2FHJ4K5VBT49F6H) notes; and the full [Vector Calculus — David Tong](../sources/Vector-Calculus-Tong.lingua#r_2YD2PDK99N62GBWKXXCBY69PP5) course needed to reconstruct their mathematics. Work substantial exercises across each topic, including unfamiliar geometries and explicit error estimates. Portuguese [Física III — Bernhard Johannes Lesche, UFJF](../sources/Fisica-III-Lesche-UFJF.lingua#r_0A3ZH3ZNQ5PGJ4Y05BSSCBAJE7) and [Eletromagnetismo Clássico, Volume I — Tibério Magno de Lima Alves](../sources/Eletromagnetismo-Classico-Volume-I-IFRN.lingua#r_612RCJJJDNWD62YYPE9410HHVQ) support and deepen that work. Read one complete engineering companion, [Electromagnetics and Applications — David H. Staelin](../sources/Electromagnetics-and-Applications-Staelin.lingua#r_45QC1TW6RXJBJE8Q5H98DZT5AC) or [Electromagnetic Fields and Energy — Haus and Melcher](../sources/Electromagnetic-Fields-and-Energy-Haus-Melcher.lingua#r_1VKHEEC14B3VDGBA13T6K4JQNV), and use [The Feynman Lectures on Physics, Volume II](../sources/Feynman-Lectures-Volume-II.lingua#r_436GYN2CVWCERX7EXFDTWX28XT) for sustained explanatory comparison. Commercial [Introduction to Electrodynamics — David J. Griffiths, fifth edition](../sources/Introduction-to-Electrodynamics-Griffiths.lingua#r_7X31PWVMSRZVMAH4TXJDYP8Q2X) and [Classical Electrodynamics — John David Jackson, third edition](../sources/Classical-Electrodynamics-Jackson.lingua#r_0X50CXF1V7S5XR2JJTT3PYQM24) are optional alternative companions, with authorized access.

Complete the public [Electromagnetism II — MIT 8.07, Fall 2012](../sources/Electromagnetism-II-MIT-8-07.lingua#r_55A4EMWVVACC6KS4Z03ZA91F7G) progression and the available [Electromagnetic Theory — MIT 8.311, Spring 2004](../sources/Electromagnetic-Theory-MIT-8-311.lingua#r_76PF2M392RCSAEEF88YX03ZEBH) graduate lecture, problem and examination sequence. Where course notes refer to an inaccessible book or omit a proof, identify the missing topic and work it through an available complete advanced source. A catalogue, video summary or solution copied after seeing an answer does not demonstrate the same understanding as an independent derivation and corrected attempt.

The following studies deepen specific parts of the same subject. Read each study's full primary methods, carry out at least three sustained investigations covering static/material fields, time-dependent/wave behavior and measurement or inversion, and complete the integrated and independent-research work. Others remain useful deepening paths. Experimental evidence must distinguish personally performed supervised work, analysis of authorized existing measurements and literature reconstruction. These are descriptions of learning depth, not application approval gates or new Trail features.

**Continue:** [Advanced boundary, Green-function and multipole study](../research/Advanced-boundary-Green-function-and-multipole-study.lingua#r_7K6DMSWN5GFG0AH1HFEQFYJ6HR) · [Advanced dielectric response and material measurement](../research/Advanced-dielectric-response-and-material-measurement-study.lingua#r_44CZN17YHR59MS1T36SKB30FQB) · [Advanced magnetic materials, circuits and coupling](../research/Advanced-magnetic-circuits-materials-and-coupling-study.lingua#r_3YQ7495PSE5THZV9FVQ9FR18F6) · [Advanced circuit-to-field and probe study](../research/Advanced-circuit-to-field-and-probe-study.lingua#r_3NMAAA6ARRKBX261QBQV9M3N43) · [Advanced electromechanical energy and stress study](../research/Advanced-electromechanical-energy-and-stress-study.lingua#r_3J775PFRNMS0G28Q2B6CXSHJME) · [Advanced relativistic fields, action and conservation](../research/Advanced-relativistic-field-and-action-study.lingua#r_1PN7ASKXD515XZCY9T1FDPJCP5) · [Advanced causal dispersive pulse study](../research/Advanced-causal-dispersive-pulse-study.lingua#r_2JT83809PYYT57JSB8JGW8QPBK) · [Advanced transmission, guides and resonant modes](../research/Advanced-lines-guides-resonance-and-mode-study.lingua#r_5BWBKTPS1G0F85NTJ0NSS5KYBT) · [Advanced retarded fields, radiation and antennas](../research/Advanced-retarded-fields-radiation-and-antenna-study.lingua#r_0AYMD9A6TZ9TFTAD9YFZZRP45E) · [Advanced scattering, extinction and response study](../research/Advanced-scattering-extinction-and-material-response-study.lingua#r_6VQB1CK8FSP8M7MCCWHH8Y6NSR) · [Advanced static numerical-field verification](../research/Advanced-static-numerical-field-verification-study.lingua#r_0HV1EN0TSCEJ133D4S253Z0PXD) · [Advanced time-domain, dispersion and PML validation](../research/Advanced-time-domain-dispersion-PML-and-validation-study.lingua#r_3DN369CNVW889T4MG6CAAXJGCV) · [Advanced electromagnetic inverse-problem study](../research/Advanced-electromagnetic-inverse-problem-study.lingua#r_4AAZ68A806WG3FF0AE5YMMN3F6) ·